<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Plywood year net rises 32.99 pct.</title>
<headline>Pacific Plywood year net rises 32.99 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   2.91   vs 2.19 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.8    vs 1.3</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    28.18  vs 16.47</p>
<p>    Turnover		     136.88 vs 101.81</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pacific Plywood Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 20-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Pacific Plywood is a Malaysia-based plywood manufacturer.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one warrant for every four shares held.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted for one-for-10 bonus share issue made in October 15, 1996.</p>
<p>The calculation of share earnings was based on a weighted average of 968.12 million shares vs 753.85 million shares.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 1.8 H.K. cents vs 1.3 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
